{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV9reconcile4with8deleting10preservingyACyxG_Shy10Foundation4UUIDVGALtF","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconciles this store against a snapshot covering only "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"some"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" of its IDs."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reconcile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"remote"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deleting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deletedIDs","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"text":"preserving","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The rows read from storage for the IDs in question. Rows for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"IDs the caller didn’t ask about are simply not here, and their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"absence means nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"remote"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs storage reports as deleted elsewhere. Removed with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same origin a full reconcile uses, so no deletion is recorded and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none is echoed back to the store it came from. An ID that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still holds is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" removed however it is named here: a live row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is positive evidence, and a tombstone can be stale."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"deletedIDs"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent, exactly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as in the full reconcile. ","type":"text"},{"code":"remote","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has no authority over them, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"neither does ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"text":". This store’s own un-drained ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes"},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"folded in automatically.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"preserving"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The counterpart to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)"},{"text":" for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"partial read — a refresh of the rows a sync tick reported as changed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than of the whole table. Absorbing rows works identically; what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes is where deletions come from.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A partial snapshot "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cannot"}]},{"type":"text","text":" infer deletion from absence. An ID missing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from it was not deleted, it was not asked for, and treating the two alike"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would empty the store on the first partial merge. So removal is driven"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entirely by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"type":"text","text":", which the caller must have positive evidence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for — a history tombstone, not an empty result."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" record changes — this is a hydration operation, for the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reason the full reconcile isn’t one."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/changes":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Accumulated changes since the last ","type":"text"},{"code":"resetChanges()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/changes","title":"changes","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"changes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux9ChangeSetV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ChangeSet"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EntityStore"}],"title":"EntityStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An ordered, keyed collection of identifiable entities that silently records"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every mutation for downstream persistence."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Entit